// printenv — daily-ten 20 Nov 2026 (OS track).
// Simulates `printenv`: 3 variables with values
// "/home/jayant" (len 12), "jayant" (len 6),
// "/bin/bash" (len 9). Prints each value length,
// then the variable count (3).
fn main() {
    println(len("/home/jayant"));
    println(len("jayant"));
    println(len("/bin/bash"));
    println(3);
}
